Package: GastricMicrobiomeTools
Title: Starter Tools for Exploratory 16S Microbiome Analysis
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Emile", "Yonli", email = "emiledxpe@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A starter collection of base R functions for validating
    microbiome count tables, calculating relative abundance and alpha
    diversity, and summarising taxonomic counts. Developed as an
    educational mentorship project.
